            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Brenda Niehaus"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Other than it was 20 minutes on the stove (don’t leave unattended- can boil over!!) I was very happy with the result. Tasted great in alcohol free mojitos!",
